  57:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****        Circular mode restriction:
  58:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****       (#) The DMA circular mode cannot be used when the SPI is configured in these modes:
  59:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           (##) Master 2Lines RxOnly
  60:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           (##) Master 1Line Rx
  61:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****       (#) The CRC feature is not managed when the DMA circular mode is enabled
  62:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****       (#) When the SPI DMA Pause/Stop features are used, we must use the following APIs
  63:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           the HAL_SPI_DMAPause()/ HAL_SPI_DMAStop() only under the SPI callbacks
  64:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****      [..]
  65:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****        Master Receive mode restriction:
  66:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****       (#) In Master unidirectional receive-only mode (MSTR =1, BIDIMODE=0, RXONLY=1) or
  67:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           bidirectional receive mode (MSTR=1, BIDIMODE=1, BIDIOE=0), to ensure that the SPI
  68:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           does not initiate a new transfer the following procedure has to be respected:
  69:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           (##) HAL_SPI_DeInit()
  70:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           (##) HAL_SPI_Init()
  71:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****      [..]
