  97:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****           This function allows to reset following callbacks:
  98:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****             (++) TxCpltCallback        : SPI Tx Completed callback
  99:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****             (++) RxCpltCallback        : SPI Rx Completed callback
