 102:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****             (++) RxHalfCpltCallback    : SPI Rx Half Completed callback
 103:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****             (++) TxRxHalfCpltCallback  : SPI TxRx Half Completed callback
